    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:18:41.129Z",
      "Content": "Hello, my order never arrived and I am really frustrated.",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a59-b969-7234-b70f-483e49da2bbb",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "be8d5ec9-fb63-4840-8ac3-8acb531863c6",
      "DisplayName": "Customer",
      "ParticipantRole": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:18:59.440Z",
      "Content": "I’m sorry to hear that. Can you give me your order number?",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a5a-00f0-7d62-a9f9-8b1c2f45a413",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "808371a6-fda5-46c6-a938-72525f479ab0",
      "DisplayName": "Agent",
      "ParticipantRole": "AGENT"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:19:24.459Z",
      "Content": "It is 1bb546. I paid last week and nobody has told me anything.",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a5a-62ab-72f4-8336-60c75668b716",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "be8d5ec9-fb63-4840-8ac3-8acb531863c6",
      "DisplayName": "Customer",
      "ParticipantRole": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:19:32.667Z",
      "Content": "Thank you. I can see the order was delayed at the warehouse. I will arrange a replacement today.",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a5a-82bb-7e1a-b9bf-8ad325dff3dc",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "808371a6-fda5-46c6-a938-72525f479ab0",
      "DisplayName": "Agent",
      "ParticipantRole": "AGENT"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:19:42.858Z",
      "Content": "Okay, that is better. How long will the replacement take?",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a5a-aa8a-7516-81f9-be85d8ab3363",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "be8d5ec9-fb63-4840-8ac3-8acb531863c6",
      "DisplayName": "Customer",
      "ParticipantRole": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:19:53.363Z",
      "Content": "It will arrive within three business days, and you will get a confirmation message.",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a5a-d393-78e4-8d8d-9c4c90503041",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "808371a6-fda5-46c6-a938-72525f479ab0",
      "DisplayName": "Agent",
      "ParticipantRole": "AGENT"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:20:03.837Z",
      "Content": "Great, thank you for your help.",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
      "Id": "01a13a5a-fc7d-76e7-bd7e-fb6523955b6b",
      "Type": "MESSAGE",
      "ParticipantId": "be8d5ec9-fb63-4840-8ac3-8acb531863c6",
      "DisplayName": "Customer",
      "ParticipantRole": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "AbsoluteTime": "2026-10-14T12:20:12.313Z",
      "Content": "You’re welcome. Have a good day.",
      "ContentType": "text/markdown",
